e cabelo de sobrancelha ​ ​1 x Pincel ​ ​CABO DE CARGA', 134.0, 67.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Men''s Care > Shaving & Grooming', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/cn-11134207-7ras8-mboz8l5j96q31e', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F450997010%2F42656999383', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
