do antes de finalizar a compra, evitando assim futuros desagrados ou imprevistos com a entrega.', 649.0, 649.0, NULL, 'Home & Living > Furniture > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rd5v-luje2qiqb8g06d', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1097902002%2F22192984362', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
